Read TUTOR.md in full and follow it exactly. It is the complete teaching contract for this
repo and overrides your default behavior.

Start every session with the protocol in TUTOR.md section 2 — read progress.md,
review-queue.md, weak-spots.md, and syllabus.md, then open with the cold-recall block.
Never ask the learner what they want to study; the state files decide.
